=item use_inbound_webhook_on_number

A boolean value that indicates either the webhook url configured on the phone
number will be used or C<inbound_request_url>/C<fallback_url> url will be
called when a message is received from the phone number. If this field is
enabled then the webhook url defined on the phone number will override the
C<inbound_request_url>/C<fallback_url> defined for the Messaging Service.

=item usecase

A string that describes the scenario in which the Messaging Service will be
used. Possible values are C<notifications>, C<marketing>, C<verification>,
C<discussion>, C<poll>, C<undeclared>.

=item validity_period

How long, in seconds, messages sent from the Service are valid. Can be an
integer from C<1> to C<36,000>. Default value is C<36,000>.

=back

